  "sorrowful-crowning-thorns.about-this-story.the-gospel-passage-is-quoted-word-for-word-from-the-douay-rh": "The Gospel passage is quoted word for word from the Douay-Rheims Bible, 1899 American Edition, which is in the public domain; verse numbers are omitted for reading aloud, and … marks skipped verses. The Our Father, Hail Mary, Glory Be and Fatima prayers follow the standard formulas used across this site. This mystery is traditionally prayed on Tuesday / Friday.",
